      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Eliminating Hidden Surcharges &amp; Demanding Written Binding Contracts for Bike Transport from Hyderabad</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">When you hire a packer and mover in Hyderabad to Khammam, the most common hidden cost is the moving‑day surcharge.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Dishonest transporters will add extra charges for floor elevations, long carries or toll taxes only after you have signed the contract.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>They claim the extra effort or distance, but the amount is inflated or even fabricated.</span></li></ul>

<p>Floor elevations – a single lift or stairwell can cost a few hundred rupees per floor. Dishonest operators will calculate the fee on the day, citing “unforeseen stairs” and ask you to pay on the spot.</p>

<p>Long carries – when a vehicle cannot fit inside the office or house, the driver has to carry the load over a distance of 50–100 m. Some firms add a “carry‑out” fee ranging from ₹500 to ₹1,500 per vehicle. The driver will insist that you pay for the extra distance only when you arrive.</p>

<p>Toll taxes – highways between Hyderabad and Khammam have toll plazas. While the transport company’s official rate includes a standard toll amount, unscrupulous firms will charge you the full toll plus a 10–20 % markup on the day of the move.</p>

